00010001  // 0: LDI 1   - ACC = 1
00111111  // 1: STA 15  - mem[15] = 1 (decrement constant)
00010011  // 2: LDI 3   - ACC = 3 (loop counter)
01011111  // 3: SUB 15  - ACC = ACC - 1, sets zero flag on last pass
10110110  // 4: JZ 6    - counter hit zero -> exit loop
10100011  // 5: JMP 3   - keep counting down
11010000  // 6: OUT     - ACC should be 0
11100000  // 7: HLT
11100000  // padding: HLT so a runaway PC stops instead of fetching x
11100000
11100000
11100000
11100000
11100000
11100000
11100000
